@defgroup micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-utility-functions Utility Functions
@brief Utility functions for handling strings in tests.

@details
The functions of the `utility` namespace help with the strings that the
tests often check: `utility::is_match()` matches a string against a
pattern with the `*` and `?` wildcards, `utility::split()` splits a
string into a vector of the non-empty sub-strings separated by any of the
delimiter characters, and
`utility::extract_file_name()` returns the file name part of a path.
